abstract: "A reproducible, falsifiable measurement of sports antagonism across all 1,225 pairs of U.S. states. Illinois-Wisconsin is the favorite (first in 66.9% of 800 simulations, top three in 94.8%); no winner is declared because 4 of 12 verdict gates fail. See README.md and docs/RESULTS.md."
